| Builder advisory credential | Fact about a builder advisory pass | `e_009376` (Arthur Pendelton holds an active **Master Builder Advisory Pass**) | Direct match |
| Annual corporate backing ≥ $50,000 | Fact about funding amount | `e_00bce5` (Arthur Pendelton's corporate sponsorship funding is **$60,000**) | Satisfies the ≥ $50,000 condition |
| Active diplomatic VIP credential | Fact about diplomatic VIP pass | `e_009335` (Arthur Pendelton holds a **verified Global Diplomatic VIP Pass**) | Direct match |

